*      FAP    FPTCT     FLOATING PT. OVER/UNDERFLOW COUNTER             FPTCT000
       COUNT  52                                                        FPTCT010
       ENTRY  FPTCT          CALL FPTCT(I)                              FPTCT020
       ENTRY  FPTST          CALL FPTST                                 FPTCT021
 FPTCT CLA    FPTRA                                                     FPTCT030
       STO    8              SET LOC,N 8 TO TRA FPTRA+1                 FPTCT040
       CLA    1,4                                                       FPTCT050
       STA    I1             SET I-ADDRESS                              FPTCT060
       STA    I2                                                        FPTCT070
       TRA    2,4                                                       FPTCT080
 FPTST CLA   $(FPT)          TO RESTORE TRA  (FPT)                      FPTCT100
       STO    8              IN LOC,N 8                                 FPTCT110
       TRA    1,4                                                       FPTCT120
 FPTRA TRA    FPTRA+1                                                   FPTCT130
       SXA    AXT,4          FROM LOC,N 8                               FPTCT140
       LXD    0,4            XR4=FPT SPILL CODE IN DECR.(0)             FPTCT150
       TXL    BRNCH,4,15     ONLY LAST FOUR BITS HAVE MEANING           FPTCT160
 ERROR OCT 042042042042      HPR PAUSE TO INDICATE FPT ERROR-SEEXR4     FPTCT170
       TRA    AXT            PRESS START TO IGNORE ERROR                FPTCT180
       XCA             -18                                              FPTCT190
 AXT   AXT    **,4     -17                                              FPTCT200
       TRA*   0              RETURN TO TRAPPED LOCN+1 VIA ADR.(0)       FPTCT210
       TRA    ERROR    -15             /OMQ+AC                          FPTCT220
       TRA    ERROR    -14             /OAC BUT MQ O.K.                 FPTCT230
       TXI    DIVO,4,18-13             /OMQ, AC O.K.       -COUNT+      FPTCT240
       TRA    ERROR    -12             /O BUT AC+MQ O.K.                FPTCT250
       TXI    DIVU,4,18-11             /U AC+MQ       -COUNT-           FPTCT260
       TRA    AXT      -10             /U AC, MQ O.K.      -IGNORE      FPTCT270
       TXI    DIVU,4,18-9              /U MQ, AC O.K.      -COUNT-      FPTCT280
       TRA    ERROR    -8              /U BUT AC+MQ O.K.                FPTCT290
       TXI    ACCO,4,17-7              +-*O AC+MQ  -COUNT+              FPTCT300
       TXI    ACCO,4,17-6              +-*O AC     -COUNT+              FPTCT310
       TRA    ERROR    -5              +-*O MQ BUT AC O.K.              FPTCT320
       TRA    ERROR    -4              +-*O BUT AC+MQ O.K.              FPTCT330
       TXI    ACCU,4,17-3              +-*U AC+MQ  -COUNT-              FPTCT340
       TRA    ERROR    -2              +-*U AC BUT MQ O.K.              FPTCT350
       TRA    AXT      -1              +-*U MQ, AC O.K.  -IGNORE        FPTCT360
 LIST  TRA    ERROR    -0              NOTHING HAPPENED                 FPTCT370
 DIVU  XCA                                                              FPTCT380
 ACCU  STO    TEMP                                                      FPTCT390
       CLS    ONE            COUNT -1 FOR UNDERFLOW                     FPTCT400
 I1    ADD    I1                                                        FPTCT410
 I2    STO    I1                                                        FPTCT420
       CLA    TEMP           CLEAR P-BIT     (256)                      FPTCT430
 BRNCH TRA    LIST,4                                                    FPTCT440
 DIVO  XCA                                                              FPTCT450
 ACCO  STO    TEMP                                                      FPTCT460
       CLA    ONE            COUNT +1 FOR OVERFLOW                      FPTCT470
       TRA    I1                                                        FPTCT480
 ONE   OCT    1000000                            48 LOCNS               FPTCT490
 TEMP  OCT     0                                    V.KAHAN    AUG 1963 FPTCT500
       END                                                              FPTCT510
